Subject: Widen GitLab 19 gem pins for published fixes

GitLab 19.5 keeps rubyzip below 3.4, the bundled safe_zip gem requires rubyzip 2.4, and mail remains at 2.9.0. The omnibus-only license_finder gem also caps rubyzip below 3 and is not installed in this image, so that pin is removed.

Origin: DHI-internal (gem constraint remediation)
Description: Raise rubyzip to 3.4 in the GitLab 19 Gemfile and bundled safe_zip gemspec, raise mail to 2.9.1, and remove the omnibus-only license_finder gem.
CVE: CVE-2026-63435
CVE: CVE-2026-85396
Base-Tree: git https://gitlab.com/gitlab-org/gitlab-foss.git 0d4c9a9a2fa291df4d2c9be7e07e41e70249b2bf
Verify: cmd `grep -E "^gem '(rubyzip|mail)'" Gemfile && grep rubyzip gems/safe_zip/safe_zip.gemspec` expect "Gemfile rubyzip 3.4 and mail 2.9.1; safe_zip gemspec rubyzip 3.4"
Forwarded: not-needed (dependency floors are packaging pins for this image)
Drop-When: never: GitLab 19.5 still pins rubyzip below 3.4 in both dependency files and mail at 2.9.0

diff --git a/Gemfile b/Gemfile
--- a/Gemfile
+++ b/Gemfile
@@ -140,7 +140,7 @@
 
 # GitLab Pages
 gem 'validates_hostname', '~> 1.0.13', feature_category: :pages
-gem 'rubyzip', '~> 2.4.0', require: 'zip', feature_category: :pages
+gem 'rubyzip', '~> 3.4.0', require: 'zip', feature_category: :pages
 # GitLab Pages letsencrypt support
 gem 'acme-client', '~> 2.0.19', feature_category: :pages
 
@@ -723,7 +723,7 @@
 # `config/initializers/mail_starttls_patch.rb` has also been patched to
 # fix STARTTLS handling until https://github.com/mikel/mail/pull/1536 is
 # released.
-gem 'mail', '= 2.9.0', feature_category: :notifications
+gem 'mail', '= 2.9.1', feature_category: :notifications
 gem 'mail-smtp_pool', '~> 0.1.0', path: 'gems/mail-smtp_pool', require: false, feature_category: :notifications
 
 gem 'microsoft_graph_mailer', '~> 0.1.0', path: 'vendor/gems/microsoft_graph_mailer',
@@ -813,5 +813,3 @@
 # standard Gem, version increase to resolve vulnerabilities
 gem "zlib", "~> 3.2", ">= 3.2.3", feature_category: :shared # rubocop:todo Gemfile/MissingFeatureCategory -- https://gitlab.com/gitlab-org/gitlab/-/work_items/596593
 
-# Gems required in omnibus-gitlab pipeline
-gem 'license_finder', '~> 7.0', require: false, feature_category: :build
diff --git a/gems/safe_zip/safe_zip.gemspec b/gems/safe_zip/safe_zip.gemspec
--- a/gems/safe_zip/safe_zip.gemspec
+++ b/gems/safe_zip/safe_zip.gemspec
@@ -18,7 +18,7 @@ Gem::Specification.new do |spec|
   spec.files         = Dir["lib/**/*.rb"]
   spec.require_paths = ["lib"]

-  spec.add_dependency "rubyzip", "~> 2.4"
+  spec.add_dependency "rubyzip", "~> 3.4"

   spec.add_development_dependency "gitlab-styles", "~> 14.0"
   spec.add_development_dependency "rspec", "~> 3.0"
